ratorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}(\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-142142/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c6a58962-cb06-519a-8c64-0dfa3b9c14d7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-142142"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-274500/field-1/e7f6c27482797e11bd6b0013338edc6789517ab47eb94f4fe9912fc5f8b6c4b8" :answer/id #uuid "0c5e1efa-ff51-56cb-837a-c4d3b889a015" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-274500/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "c52e9aba-9d95-5400-b6a5-59d352eaa866" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-274500/field-1/e7f6c27482797e11bd6b0013338edc6789517ab47eb94f4fe9912fc5f8b6c4b8" :answer-field/choices ["q-274500/field-1/e7f6c27482797e11bd6b0013338edc6789517ab47eb94f4fe9912fc5f8b6c4b8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-274500/field-2/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "9ccaa835-20e2-54ee-9424-9434ab7c95f6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-274500/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "a6771cb9-7d56-5d52-a5b9-3b5bc8ff75ef" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-274500/field-2/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer-field/choices ["q-274500/field-2/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-274500" :question/id #uuid "431a59af-798d-5f13-b9e1-c4c58d8d7c69" :question/math-academy-id "q-274500" :question/problem "Express $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+\\frac{5\\pi }{3})$ in terms of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ and $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\n$\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+\\frac{5\\pi }{3})=$\n{{field-1}}$\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,+$\n{{field-2}}$\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$" :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the sum formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(u+v)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v-\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the sum formula for cosine with $u=x$ and $v=\\frac{5\\pi }{3}$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+\\frac{5\\pi }{3}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{3})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-274500/field-1" "q-274500/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "831f9aa0-099e-5e0c-8a9d-c4828b629f64"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-274500"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-332517/field-1/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer/id #uuid "1d9eb62b-7e67-5309-a024-93c8ab705e6a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-332517/field-1/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "f895e217-87aa-5050-8766-c789562b563a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-332517/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "c8ce9289-8a1b-5e6a-b84a-e0a441b6cb47" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-332517/field-1/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer-field/choices ["q-332517/field-1/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" "q-33